  × the `+` append marker is not allowed on `(env)` declarations
   ╭─[jig.kdl:2:8]
 1 │ foo {
 2 │   (env)+X "y"
   ·        ─┬
   ·         ╰── `+` on env declaration
 3 │ }
   ╰────
  help: remove the leading `+` — env vars take a single value per name; declare the variable once per scope
